        "original_id": "a34fe61f-3cc7-57e5-809d-f0cb8ef80258",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dave Silk\n- Events: Miracle on Ice, 1980 Winter Olympics men's ice hockey tournament\n- Places: Scituate, Cohasset, Massachusetts, Lake Placid, New York\n\nFacts:\n- Dave Silk was born on January 1, 1958 in Scituate, Massachusetts.\n- Dave Silk was raised in Scituate and Cohasset, Massachusetts.\n- Dave Silk is a retired professional American ice hockey player.\n- The Miracle on Ice refers to a medal-round game during the men's ice hockey tournament at the 1980 Winter Olympics in Lake Placid, New York.\n- The Miracle on Ice game was played between the host United States team and the defending gold medalist Soviet Union team.",
